  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "band-0",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "FOUNDATIONS\n\nCalm and clinical. White ground, one deep green, hairline borders instead of shadows.\n\nSaturated colour is reserved for meaning — red for a severe allergy, amber for a missed dose.\n\nBangla is the default: body sets 15/26 against English 15/24, and every container is sized to the Bangla measure so switching languages never reflows."
    },
    {
      "id": "band-1",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 1290,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "FIRST RUN\n\nThe promise leads, not the legal text.\n\nWelcome → disclaimer → ad consent → create family. Permissions come later, at first use — never here."
    },
    {
      "id": "band-2",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 2284,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "CORE\n\nFive fixed tabs: Home, Timeline, Medications, Calendar, More.\n\nHome is the family, not one person — every other health app opens on an individual. Emergency sits on Home, one tap away."
    },
    {
      "id": "band-3",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 3278,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "MEDICATIONS & VISITS\n\nThe Medications artboard is LIVE — tap নিয়েছি, snooze or skip and the card settles, the counter and progress bar move.\n\nThis is the loop that decides whether the app gets opened tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "id": "band-4",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 4272,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "RECORDS\n\nJotno records; it does not interpret.\n\nLab values show their reference range, never coloured good or bad. Vaccination dates are user-entered — no schedule is recommended.\n\nOne prescription can produce several medications; the slip is scanned once."
    },
    {
      "id": "band-5",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 5266,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "EMERGENCY\n\nRead by a stranger, under stress, on a locked phone.\n\nAllergy above blood group, blood group above medication. Every number dials on tap.\n\nApp lock exposes this and nothing else."
    },
    {
      "id": "band-6",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 6260,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "DATA & PRIVACY\n\nThe privacy story has to survive its edge cases.\n\nSaving the recovery phrase beside the backup gets a warning. Deleting locally does not touch cloud backups, and says so. A corrupted backup is named, never hidden."
    },
    {
      "id": "band-7",
      "x": -470,
      "y": 7254,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "APP ICON\n\nA heart built from two leaf lobes — যত্ন, care.\n\nThe lobes are leaf tips, not heart bumps. That is the whole difference between this and a wellness cliché.\n\nBelow 44px the side veins close into a smudge, so they drop and the stroke thickens. One icon, two drawings."
    }
  ],
  "launch": {
    "view": "canvas"
  }
}